      "caveat": "Every entity of “Mutational Signature Contribution Scores (COSMIC v2)” (mutational_signatures_contribution_v2) compared across the cohorts, one value per sample as the study recorded it, from each cohort's own samples. Values that are not numbers (a limit such as \">8\", or NA) are left out (0 of them). Each entity is tested with Welch's t-test from each cohort's n, mean and variance; with thousands of samples a tiny difference is significant, so read the means too. 30 entities tested; q is Benjamini–Hochberg across all of them. 0 were not tested: fewer than 3 samples with a value in some cohort, or no spread. ",
